EESchema Schematic File Version 4
EELAYER 30 0
EELAYER END
$Descr User 36600 30300
encoding utf-8
Sheet 1 1
Title "Traction Inverter 220 kW — Power board (3x EconoDUAL 3 SiC)"
Date "2026-09-09"
Rev "A.2"
Comp "Traction Inverter 220 kW pk - Power (HV), sheet 1 of 2"
Comment1 "Inverter = Power board (HV) + Control card (LV) over a 40-way harness; safe state holds with the harness lost"
Comment2 "Content: 3x HCS600FH120D3C1 (1200 V/600 A EconoDUAL 3) + 320 uF link + active/passive discharge + iso sensing"
Comment3 "26 functional sections - 309 components - cross-section links are net labels; wires are pin stubs only"
Comment4 "Every component carries MPN + LCSC fields (CLASS = buy to class spec, ALT footprint-compatible second source in BOM)"
$EndDescr
